WEBVTT

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:27.400
Nishi! Get in there!

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:28.770
I said, get in there!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:32.480
Come on, it's the final round!

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:34.190
Get in there with your right!

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:36.650
It's the final round! The final round, you hear!?

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:43.160
Stop!

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:48.750
What the hell was that about, Nishi?

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:52.750
You heard him! Why didn't you get in closer during the final round?

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:56.340
S-Sorry, my right hand's just been feeling

00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:57.760
a little funny lately...

00:01:57.760 --> 00:01:59.760
What? Your right hand?

00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:03.930
Mammoth Nishi!

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:06.230
You won on decision. Get out there.

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:18.450
Hey, so how'd the check-up go?

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:23.450
The commission doctor said we should take him to the university hospital for an X-ray.

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:26.290
You didn't break it, did you?

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:29.580
Whatever it is, I'll be taking Nishi there now.

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:31.130
Joe, you head home by yourself.

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:32.670
Oh, come on! I wanna go too!

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:36.760
No, go home! You've got to prepare for your match with Tiger!

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:40.590
Yeah! You'd better go home and hit the sandbag!

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:42.680
Okay, but you gotta get that checked out!

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:08.870
Overwhelmingly in Tiger's favor, eh?

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:14.210
That's total bull!

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:17.300
Aren't you forgetting that he's up against the great Yabuki-sama?

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:29.810
Welcome home!

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:32.350
Oh, hey! Didn't expect to see you here!

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:34.190
Are you alone?

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:35.860
What about Danpei-san and Nishi-kun?

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:40.320
Well, Nishi hurt his hand during his match,

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:41.860
so they've gone over to the university hospital.

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:43.490
Oh!

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:47.330
Still, Nishi won, even if it was by the judges' decision.

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:54.130
Are you training now?

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:56.880
Here's some clean training clothes.

00:03:58.050 --> 00:03:59.420
Oh, thanks for that!

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:01.720
I washed them for you!

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:04.930
You're really rough around the edges, aren't you?

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:07.560
They're clean now!

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:09.560
They're clean, huh?

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:15.400
Well, I'd better go home so I don't disturb your training.

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:17.570
I really gotta thank you for everything.

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:22.650
Then I'll see you next Sunday!

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:25.660
Sunday?

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:28.120
Oh, did you forget?

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:31.660
Didn't you say you'd take me to the Mukojima Flower Garden next Sunday?

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:33.660
Oh, did I?

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:36.540
Come on, already!

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:38.590
We were supposed to go to Sanja-sama the other day, {note: also known as Asakusa Shrine}

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:40.960
but you said you couldn't because Nishi-san's match was coming up, remember?

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:44.010
So you promised we'd definitely go to Mukojima Garden this Sunday!

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:45.930
Wasn't it Nishi that said that?

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:47.220
No, it wasn't!

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:51.720
You were there too, and you promised you'd be there!

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:53.350
Did I really?

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:56.690
But I've got no time to go out and have fun.

00:04:57.310 --> 00:04:58.820
You understand, don't you?

00:04:58.820 --> 00:05:02.360
I have to take the championship belt from Tiger Ozaki!

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:04.280
You should just go with Nishi.

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:06.200
So you're a liar.

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:08.700
Liar? But I didn't...

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:10.330
Forget it! Goodbye!

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:50.700
Hey! How's your hand?

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:54.080
Well, it ain't completely broken, but the bone's a little cracked.

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:55.580
Cracked?

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:57.620
He has to take care of it.

00:05:57.620 --> 00:06:00.880
A broken hand is fatal to a boxer!

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:12.100
Oh, Nishi, Nori-chan was just here...

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:13.510
She wanted to go to the flower garden.

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:14.970
Oh, really?

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:18.140
Why don't you shave that scruff?

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:19.980
You can go too, can't you?

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:22.440
You already know what I'm gonna say!

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:24.730
I've got no time for some flower garden!

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:37.000
Joe, once you've finished eating, it's time for your after-dinner training.

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:40.330
Well, wanna join me, Nishi?

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:49.090
I'll train with you in Nishi's place.

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:50.890
You, old man?

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:53.100
Yeah! I'll take you on personally!

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:57.100
Well, that might have worked for the old me, but nowadays I'm not so sure...

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:01.020
Sorry. It's all my fault for screwing up.

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:03.400
Well, that's life.

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:05.440
This is just one of the sad things

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:07.880
about being a lowly gym with only two boxers. Right?

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:12.070
Now, Chairman, I humbly request a spar with you!

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:16.990
Keep it going!

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:20.580
Right! Right uppercut!

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:21.250
Now left!

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:24.130
Left! Harder!

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:29.590
Okay, stop!

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:32.090
What's wrong? You don't seem all that into it.

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:38.810
Your upcoming opponent is nothing like the small fry you've faced in the past!

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:41.230
You gotta put your all into it!

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:42.980
How do you expect me to give it my all?

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:45.150
I can't give my all when I'm hitting an old man's gloves!

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:50.740
I've been jumping rope, hitting the sandbag and the speed ball,

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:52.660
and I'm sick of it all!

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:54.740
What's your problem?

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:56.160
You're being impatient!

00:07:57.030 --> 00:07:58.910
Of course I'm not impatient!

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:01.160
I know that my next opponent is no small fry!

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:05.170
I just want to do some sparring with a proper partner!

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:06.750
Don't you get that?

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:24.730
I'll be your sparring partner!

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:27.270
Nishi, you...

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:30.650
You idiot! What if you break your hand?

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:32.280
You'll be done for as a boxer!

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:36.280
I don't care! Joe's got bigger worries than I do!

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:38.490
I have to do something to help...

00:08:38.490 --> 00:08:41.250
You can't possibly be a proper sparring partner

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:44.670
for someone challenging the national champion, Tiger Ozaki!

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:50.340
Y-You're

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:52.380
the chairman of Bokuto Gym!

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:56.970
My gym's crawling with young bantamweight boxers.

00:08:56.970 --> 00:09:00.180
They'll agree to be your sparring partner anytime you want.

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:02.930
You hear that, old man?

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:04.390
What did you come here for?

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:08.520
What did I come here for? To say hello, of course!

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:11.320
I came to check up on Yabuki Joe,

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:16.320
since I was worried about the high-expectations rookie taking on Tiger Ozaki.{the Association has high expectations of him}

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:20.580
Well, whaddya say? Wanna come over for some sparring?

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:22.330
Thanks, but we have to refuse!

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:25.160
Tange Gym's boxers have never trained outside the gym!

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:26.870
And we don't plan on starting anytime soon!

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:28.790
We'll do things our way, so stay out of our business!

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:31.840
Come on, Joe! It's time to work up a sweat!

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:38.840
Hey, old man, I'm gonna go over to Bokuto Gym.

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:40.300
What did you say?

00:09:41.350 --> 00:09:43.810
They're being kind enough to offer me a sparring partner!

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:45.890
No point in being stubborn, is there?

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:47.770
I'd rather accept his goodwill!

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:50.730
"His goodwill?"

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:01.620
Think about it! You're their target!

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:03.990
He's one of the guys plotting to crush you

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:07.160
for having knocked out your opponents one after another!

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:10.880
There's no telling what they'll do if you spar with them!

00:10:10.880 --> 00:10:14.130
There's nothing to worry about. 
You've just got a persecution complex.

00:10:14.130 --> 00:10:17.420
Besides, I'd like to see anyone try and crush me!

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:20.510
Joe...

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:28.940
And I'd like to at least show my appreciation to the people who gave me

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:30.350
the honor of fighting Tiger Ozaki.

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:35.360
I've always been a guy who gets more fired-up the stronger my opponents are.

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:40.530
So, shall we go, Chairman?

00:10:41.320 --> 00:10:42.830
Real sorry you had to see that.

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:45.040
Guess getting old really does make you more cynical.

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:48.040
Joe, don't! I'm begging you!

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:50.580
Come on, don't you start too!

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:54.380
Anyway, you better take Nori-chan to the flower garden, Nishi!

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:56.420
She's looking forward to it! Got it?

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:58.260
Then let's be off.

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:02.510
Well, I'll be back! Later!

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:05.640
We gotta do something, old man!

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:08.180
He must have some ulterior motive to his kindness!

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:10.600
And Joe may not have noticed yet,

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:14.610
but if they find out Joe's inability to hit the temple,

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:17.110
then he's done for!

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:24.370
Old man!

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:27.370
He won't listen to reason.

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:30.870
So there's no use being hysterical about it.

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:35.880
Nishi, you watch the gym!

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:41.590
Well, you sure don't manage one of Japan's leading gyms for nothing!

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:44.390
This is a fine car, Mr. Bokuto Gym Chairman!

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:45.800
Go ahead and get in.

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:48.220
Joe! Wait!

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:50.350
Wait up, Joe!

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:52.770
What's your problem? You're not done arguing yet?

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:53.810
Get off my back already...

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:57.020
I'm coming with you.

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:03.240
Well, you're sure quick on the uptake!

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:04.990
That's just what I like about you!

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:07.990
Save it. I can't leave you alone.

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:14.330
Sorry to cause you trouble.

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:15.790
I'm like a spoiled daughter, aren't I?{tl: "sheltered"}

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:17.340
Arrogant son of a bitch...

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:18.420
Quit your yapping!

00:12:19.260 --> 00:12:20.300
Yes, sir!

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:38.980
Now, God only knows what'll happen...

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:41.820
We'll have to deal with whatever comes up!

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:57.080
Well, if this isn't a fancy gym!

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:59.300
Not as fancy as Shiraki Gym or Asia Gym,

00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:01.840
but way better than Tange Gym. Ain't that right, old man?

00:13:02.420 --> 00:13:04.340
I don't know if I should consider that a compliment.

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:10.310
This way. Come right on in.

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:12.640
Wow, looks pretty lively in there!

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:15.890
This sound's really revving me up!

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:16.770
Right in here.

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:29.660
Just look at this lively crowd!

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:31.830
May I have your attention, everyone?

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:36.870
I'm sure you're all familiar with them,

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:39.590
but this is the chairman of Tange Gym and Yabuki-kun.

00:13:39.590 --> 00:13:42.630
He doesn't have a suitable sparring partner at Tange Gym,

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:44.840
so I've invited him here.

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:49.300
Hi! Hey, there! So that's the deal!

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:51.350
I'm looking forward to this, guys!

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:52.430
Sure is cocky...

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:55.600
So what's your class?

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:56.850
I'd say you're a lightweight.

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:58.100
Aren't you a little fat for it?

00:13:58.520 --> 00:13:59.610
A real comedian, huh?

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:00.810
Who does he think he is?

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:05.320
Hey, Inoki! Aren't you a bantamweight like Yabuki?

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:07.400
Spar with him for two or three rounds!

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:11.120
I said, spar with him!

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:13.990
You mean me?

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:15.120
Hey, just do it!

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:18.120
Hey! Let's have a clean fight!

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:19.630
Okay, let's get to it.

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:22.130
<i>H-Hey, the changing rooms are at the end of the hall!</i>

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:24.960
It's not like there are any women watching.

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:26.130
So what's wrong with me changing here?

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:28.380
Well, I suppose you're right...

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:42.150
Okay, let's go for it!

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:45.730
H-Hold it, Joe! What about your headgear?

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:47.150
Did you put on your cup?

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:50.280
You gotta be kidding me! I don't need those things!

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:51.620
You can't go without them!

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:55.370
You've got a match ahead of you! What if you get injured?

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:59.580
Don't you worry about a thing. It's not like any of these chumps can injure me.

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:06.510
Well, let's get this started!

00:15:06.510 --> 00:15:08.050
Somebody ring the bell for us!

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:11.760
It seems he's turned a deaf ear to your warnings, Tange-kun.

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:13.760
Okay, here we go!

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:14.930
You got it!

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:19.310
Give him your best shot!

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:21.980
Come on, what's with that deer-in-the-headlights stance?

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:24.820
Guess you're no big deal, after all!

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:28.940
Joe's getting far too cocky...

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:30.820
As long as he doesn't headbutt him...

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:33.820
Got it.

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:45.000
What do you think you are, a boar in a zoo?

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:48.300
Stop pacing around the ropes and bring it!

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:51.970
Then I guess I'll make the first move!

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:05.520
How's that?

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:11.450
Are you all right?

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:14.360
That won't do, Bokuto Gym Chairman!

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:16.700
You gotta bring me someone with more backbone!

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:18.660
That guy was like hitting a sandbag!

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:20.160
That's not even sparring!

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:23.670
Damn him...

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:25.500
I'll do it, Chairman!

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:27.500
Let me at him next!

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:30.670
You're a lightweight, aren't you, idiot?

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:31.420
You stay out of this!

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:35.010
Hey, Yasu! You're up next!

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:36.720
Got it.

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:39.930
Make it quick, all right?

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:43.640
I'll cool down otherwise!

00:16:53.650 --> 00:16:56.870
Oh, you seem better than the other guy, at least!

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:59.160
But you're still just a sandbag with hair!

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:00.160
Well, here I come!

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:09.420
You're doing it!

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:09.420
<i>That's the way!</i>

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:16.050
Good. Send them in.

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:16.550
Yes, sir.

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:23.480
When are you going to quit playing around?

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:32.650
Dammit, what's the matter, Yasu?

00:17:32.650 --> 00:17:33.990
Fight back already!

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:37.490
Sorry to keep you waiting. Now, come on in.

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:39.030
They're in the middle of sparring.{moved "now come on in" to the previous line - ninja}

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:41.080
Good. Thanks for your help.

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:44.040
Let's go on in, Tiger.

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:50.000
C'mon, c'mon, c'mon, c'mon!

00:17:57.050 --> 00:18:01.220
Don't you have anyone who can put up a fight, Bokuto Gym Chairman?

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:04.520
Anyone who can put a little pressure on me? Well, do ya?

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:09.230
Hey, Bokuto Gym Chairman,

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:12.900
stop disappointing me and give me someone with a little backbone!

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:16.450
Okay, okay.

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:18.110
Okay, Kurashima. You're up next.

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:22.080
You sure about this, Chairman?

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:23.120
He's skinny as a beanpole!

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:27.620
Kurashima here is the star rookie of Bokuto Gym, sitting on a 12-win streak.

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:29.500
Star rookie, eh?

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:32.790
I'd rather have a ranked boxer myself...

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:35.630
But beggars can't be choosers.

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:38.470
Beat that bastard to a pulp!

00:18:38.470 --> 00:18:40.100
Don't let him talk that way ever again!

00:18:40.100 --> 00:18:41.180
Get him!

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:53.150
What the hell? How'd you get a 12-win streak like that?

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:10.500
Hey, this isn't kickboxing!

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:12.380
What are you, crazy?

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:15.090
Joe, what was that all about? That looked like a brawl!

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:17.010
There's something wrong with you today, Joe!

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:20.340
You're in another gym, so stop losing your cool! It's shameful!

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:23.100
I'm not losing my cool.

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:26.310
I just got a little pissed when I saw the spectators on the second floor.

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:40.070
Tiger!

00:19:40.070 --> 00:19:42.740
And the other gym chairmen!

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:46.580
You were absolutely right, old man.

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:49.790
They wouldn't give me a sparring partner for nothing.

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:53.630
They were checking out my moves from up there!

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:56.090
Not that it's any reason for me to panic,

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:58.380
but their dirty methods pissed me right off!

00:19:58.380 --> 00:20:00.760
Sneaking around like that...

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:03.220
Hey, Tiger!

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:07.430
Why don't you come down here and spar with me, if you have the balls?

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:08.720
Well? Come down, will ya?

00:20:09.470 --> 00:20:11.730
You filthy spy boxer!

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:13.050
What?

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:16.570
Cocky son of a...

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:16.570
<i>Tiger, no!</i>

00:20:16.570 --> 00:20:18.820
Tiger, we'll handle him!

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:23.160
We may have been found out, but we've got enough intel for you to win your match!

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:28.490
Well, Tiger-san? You scared or what?

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:31.620
Don't you think it'll be easier to scout me in an actual fight

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:33.620
rather than spying on me with your notebooks and cameras?

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:39.090
Well, I guess you're the kind of chickenshit champion who hides on the balcony.

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:41.760
I'll bet you don't have the guts to spar with me here!

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:45.550
Come on, old man. Let's go home.

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:48.180
Man, what a waste of time.

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:51.770
If I'd known I'd be sparring against such half-assed novices,

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:53.940
I'd have spent my time jumping rope!

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:13.960
What the hell, assholes?

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:15.750
Well, sorry we're just small fry!

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:18.170
Sorry we're such half-assed novices!

00:21:18.170 --> 00:21:20.960
You're dead wrong if you think we'll just let you head home.

00:21:20.960 --> 00:21:23.260
Oh, showing our true colors, are we?

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:24.880
You're make-believe gangsters now?

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:27.220
We gave you enough time to spew your bullshit.

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:28.390
Get 'im, boys!

00:21:28.390 --> 00:21:29.720
Wait!

00:21:29.720 --> 00:21:31.140
I apologize for Joe's rash remarks!

00:21:31.140 --> 00:21:32.270
Just spare him, please!

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:34.640
Joe has an important match ahead of him!

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:36.520
Bring it on!

00:21:38.860 --> 00:21:41.360
Wanna fight, small fry? I'll take you all on!

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:42.110
Come on!

00:21:43.940 --> 00:21:46.700
This is how sparring's gotta be!

00:21:46.700 --> 00:21:47.950
Don't do this to him!

00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:50.080
Blame me, not Joe!

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:53.080
Asshole!

00:22:40.580 --> 00:22:42.710
Y-You okay, old man?

00:22:51.600 --> 00:22:55.720
I'm grateful that I went to spar at Bokuto Gym.

00:22:55.720 --> 00:23:00.190
Now I know they'll do anything to bury me.

00:23:02.730 --> 00:23:05.780
But I won't give in, old man.

00:23:05.780 --> 00:23:10.160
I'll make every single one of them bow down at my feet!

00:23:10.160 --> 00:23:13.950
And Tiger Ozaki is gonna be the first!

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:17.700
I won't give in, old man!

00:23:17.700 --> 00:23:19.120
I swear I won't give in!

00:23:30.800 --> 00:23:32.640
I'm not going to give in!

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:05.710
Yuke kouya wo

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:05.710
Go to the wilderness!

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:09.550
Oira boxer

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:09.550
I am a boxer.

00:24:10.340 --> 00:24:17.310
Yuuhi ga giragira otoko no yume wa

00:24:10.340 --> 00:24:17.310
The evening sun glitters upon the dreams of men!

00:24:19.020 --> 00:24:22.980
Minna wa kono ore wo nasakemuyo to iu

00:24:19.020 --> 00:24:22.980
Everyone says that I am merciless.

00:24:22.980 --> 00:24:25.020
Tsuki ni hoete hitori

00:24:22.980 --> 00:24:25.020
Howling at the moon alone.

00:24:27.110 --> 00:24:31.240
Oyanashi yadonashi no na mo nai boxer wa

00:24:27.110 --> 00:24:31.240
A parentless, homeless, nameless boxer

00:24:31.240 --> 00:24:34.240
Kusari wo kamikitta Yeah Yeah!

00:24:31.240 --> 00:24:34.240
has bitten off his chains! Yeah, yeah!

00:24:35.950 --> 00:24:38.870
Yuke kouya wo

00:24:35.950 --> 00:24:38.870
Go to the wilderness!

00:24:40.080 --> 00:24:42.580
Oira boxer

00:24:40.080 --> 00:24:42.580
I am a boxer.

00:24:43.710 --> 00:24:50.840
Asahi ga noboru yo otoko no mune ni {removed the Woo, but otherwise japanese is unchanged - Reed}

00:24:43.710 --> 00:24:50.840
The morning sun rises upon the hearts of men!

00:24:53.930 --> 00:24:57.350
The Joe vs. Tiger match has arrived, and Tiger's punches burst forth!

00:24:57.350 --> 00:24:59.310
Joe is cornered and in agony!

00:24:59.310 --> 00:25:01.980
And suddenly, the TKO towel is thrown in!

00:25:01.980 --> 00:25:05.600
Now, as Joe stands in the ring, dumbfounded by the unexpected conclusion,

00:25:05.600 --> 00:25:07.110
which way is tomorrow!?
